{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "9 Trials of Whiskers",
    "steam_appid": 3564700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/9d5ce13da25028efce3bcf6b4943d5e7.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><strong>9 Trials of Whiskers</strong> is a <strong>charming yet challenging 3D platformer</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and dodge hazards as you challenge each of the 9 Trials.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/a178d4c513d21ce660da893f965a4240.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on <strong>Very Easy Difficulty\u00a0</strong>for a relaxing experience or push your limits on\u00a0<strong>Hard </strong>to master every trial and compete with <strong>your own ghost runs!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/d832d4b489021d9def4bdc00d1d8bbf6.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the Trials =(^_^)=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/2d3e0fa52a05c6a7301513a9c07ae3ad.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/9d5ce13da25028efce3bcf6b4943d5e7.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span><strong>9 Trials of Whiskers</strong> is a <strong>charming yet challenging 3D platformer</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump and dodge hazards as you challenge each of the 9 Trials.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/a178d4c513d21ce660da893f965a4240.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on <strong>Very Easy Difficulty\u00a0</strong>for a relaxing experience or push your limits on\u00a0<strong>Hard </strong>to master every trial and compete with <strong>your own ghost runs!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/d832d4b489021d9def4bdc00d1d8bbf6.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the Trials =(^_^)=</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564700/extras/2d3e0fa52a05c6a7301513a9c07ae3ad.avif?t=1750784437\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "9 Trials of Whiskers is a cute 3D precision platformer! Run, jump, and dodge hazards as you race through 9 mystical Trials. Play on Very Easy Difficulty for a relaxed climb or push your limits on Hard. Compete against ghost runs to master every challenge!",
